@startuml
title Relational Access v1 - SQL Execution Lifecycle (matches DefaultRelationalTemplate)

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

state CREATED
state VALIDATING
state CONTEXT_READY
state OBSERVATION_BEFORE
state ACQUIRING_CONNECTION
state PREPARING_STATEMENT
state CONFIGURING_STATEMENT
state BINDING_PARAMETERS
state EXECUTING
state MAPPING_OR_BUILDING_RESULT
state CLOSING_JDBC_RESOURCES
state RELEASING_CONNECTION_HANDLE
state TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION
state OBSERVATION_SUCCESS
state OBSERVATION_FAILURE
state SUCCEEDED
state FAILED

[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> VALIDATING : public API called
VALIDATING --> CONTEXT_READY : valid SqlStatement
VALIDATING --> FAILED : IllegalArgumentException\ncaller configuration bug

CONTEXT_READY --> OBSERVATION_BEFORE : build SqlExecutionContext
OBSERVATION_BEFORE --> ACQUIRING_CONNECTION : listener errors are swallowed
ACQUIRING_CONNECTION --> PREPARING_STATEMENT : ConnectionHandle acquired
PREPARING_STATEMENT --> CONFIGURING_STATEMENT : PreparedStatement created
CONFIGURING_STATEMENT --> BINDING_PARAMETERS
BINDING_PARAMETERS --> EXECUTING
EXECUTING --> MAPPING_OR_BUILDING_RESULT
MAPPING_OR_BUILDING_RESULT --> CLOSING_JDBC_RESOURCES
CLOSING_JDBC_RESOURCES --> RELEASING_CONNECTION_HANDLE
RELEASING_CONNECTION_HANDLE --> OBSERVATION_SUCCESS
OBSERVATION_SUCCESS --> SUCCEEDED : listener errors are swallowed
SUCCEEDED --> [*]

ACQUIRING_CONNECTION --> TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION : SQLException
PREPARING_STATEMENT --> TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION : SQLException
CONFIGURING_STATEMENT --> TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION : SQLException
BINDING_PARAMETERS --> TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION : SQLException
EXECUTING --> TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION : SQLException
CLOSING_JDBC_RESOURCES --> TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION : SQLException
RELEASING_CONNECTION_HANDLE --> TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION : SQLException

MAPPING_OR_BUILDING_RESULT --> OBSERVATION_FAILURE : NON_UNIQUE / mapping / generated-key error
TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION --> OBSERVATION_FAILURE : SqlExceptionTranslator
OBSERVATION_FAILURE --> FAILED : listener error cannot replace original failure
FAILED --> [*]

note bottom of TRANSLATING_SQL_EXCEPTION
Standard translator is conservative.
MySQL/PostgreSQL-specific deadlock/duplicate-key
classification can be added later as a Translator implementation.
end note

@enduml
